{"version":1,"content":"<p>英國政府圍繞蘋果公司加密數據訪問權限的爭議近日迎來重要進展。英國調查權法庭（Investigatory Powers Tribunal）裁定，政府必須確認其是否曾向蘋果發出一項秘密命令，要求該公司向執法和安全部門提供訪問加密用户數據的能力。這項裁決被視為英國政府在監控權力問題上罕見遭遇的司法挫折。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587144.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T16:40:46.164951+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T16:31:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T16:33:54.133747+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T16:33:54.133747+00:00","content_hash":"d317c76dd2822c84670837eae357ecc00408ea979105128667e42caf486e285c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}